§ `penalties and s 50`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine for an individual` `research without an institution, review or consent` EQUALS 50000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine for an individual` `failing to safeguard identifiable data` EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine for an individual` `re-identifying anonymised data` EQUALS 20000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine for an individual` `trading in human tissue` EQUALS 100000

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `failing to safeguard identifiable data` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `disclosing a tissue donor's information` EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `compelling a person to donate tissue` EQUALS 120

